{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852746408783904798","name":"crepes-and-crits-cafe☕🐈","position":77,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Run by Eliot, an immigrant human, and staffed with animals, the crepes and crits cafe is a popular hangout spot for the young children with animal features who sleep in the parks of ferrytown.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Demetrius shakes his head. \"I would take years off the end of your natural lifespan. So long as the deal is struck before you die, I will still receive my payment in a sense. Is that agreeable?\"","created_at":"2021-08-15T20:17:23.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876560227414196244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"He seems saddened by the talk of war","created_at":"2021-08-15T20:17:31.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876560259169280000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I understand. I'm just aware of the risk the men in red presented the other week to Feyrytown. I've tried to keep myself out of such affairs, both physically and socially, but found myself in the midst of things. I saw death first-hand. I do not wish you to feel robbed should some terrible unfortunatality befall myself, or worse the cafè. I may not be the smartest man, and I accept that, but if there's one thing I've learned in my time here, its to keep *my* things out in the open. Plain. And not open to interpretation. Riddles are for your side of the table. Meaning no offense Mr. Demetrius.\"","created_at":"2021-08-15T20:27:59.365000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876562892676272188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"None taken, Eliot.\" Demetrius smiles sadly. \"And the war does post a threat, yes, but I believe in your ability to keep yourself and the cafe safe. But which deal you choose is entirely up to you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-15T20:30:31.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876563530399223808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I'd like to offer the larger fee, with some stipulation. If you'll hear me out.\" Eliot reaches for his tea and takes a slow measured sip.","created_at":"2021-08-15T20:33:11.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876564201445949450","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Demetrius nods and refills his cup.","created_at":"2021-08-15T21:23:22.494000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876576830889553950","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"What memory or memories you would like, they are yours. I only ask that you don't take something that would impeed on my business to run the cafe. That being said, I've spent most of my life working towards that goal so I'm not sure what all there is to offer. I will retain the years of my mortal life up until, and no further, than the end of this conflict, afterwhich you may claim those as well. I... I just realized I errored in not asking how many...\" Eliot sighs softly as he loses some of his bravado but does regain it to continue. \"Regardless. I said what I said. In the meantime however. Should something befall me, as a down-payment towards those years. I offer these.\" Eliot slides his Drachmae over to the center of the table. \"Should something happen to me, the years I owe are yours to claim. Should things become resolved and I am still well, I request these to be returned to me in turn for the unspent years.\"","created_at":"2021-08-15T22:04:41.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876587229512884306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Demetrius nods. \"This is quite agreeable.\" He takes the Drachmae and extends a hand to shake. \"Let us say a few decades, enough to still leave you with a long enough life.\"","created_at":"2021-08-15T22:21:54.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876591563134885961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot shakes the hand with a firm silent nod.","created_at":"2021-08-15T22:23:34.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876591979671203852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"As you do you feel a sense of something lost. Should Eliot live through the war, he will die on the night after his 45th birthday. A small portion of mist flows out of Eliot's mouth and a vision can be seen in it. (Please describe what memory and associated proficiency you lose and what it looks like)","created_at":"2021-08-15T22:33:32.709000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876594489811169350","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Not one memory, but several overlapping memories flow overlapping through the mist. \n\nEliot standing in front of a mirror, a stern expression on his face. Years of over lapping memories Eliot as a small boy with with a mop of dark hair and a black eye and raggy clothes, Eliot dressed in a suit and tie his dark hair cut short,  Eliot in a frilly dress with mint colored hair, Eliot from a week ago disheveled and frightful. The same stern steely look in his eyes through the ages.  All of them muttering an unheard mantra. More memories flash of Eliot in his hometown, using that same mantra as he stands up against bullies, against thieves, against his parents. And once, only once, in the comfort of his own cafe as someone tried to steal from his register. \n\nAs the mist leaves his mouth so to does some of his steel willpower, his use of fear as a utility, his ***intimidation***. Eliot suppresses a shudder as he witness for one last time what he is losing, but its not a part of him he favored, it was something he needed, but hopefully he will never have need of... \n\n\nWhatever it was. Its gone now, and it was probably worth its cost.","created_at":"2021-08-15T22:50:46.040000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876598823915503637","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Demetrius smiles sadly as he breathes the mist in. \"Thank you, Eliot. Now please, I believe Willow would like to see you.\" He waves and a hole in the side of the tree opens to reveal the outside of the cafe where willow is waiting expectantly.","created_at":"2021-08-15T23:14:27.843000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876604787389513759","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot nods, takes one last sip of his tea before standing again. \"Once again Mr. Demetrius, your tea and hospitality are something truly special. I very much home the cafe is something you can take pride in.\" He gives a large formal, almost to long bow before exiting the tree.","created_at":"2021-08-15T23:17:45.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876605614510465085","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
